Haiku support for qtbase 6.12.0: HaikuPorts' qt6_base-6.10.3.patchset (MIT,
haikuports/haikuports dev-qt/qt6-base) carried forward. The hunks that no
longer applied were redone for 6.12: bootstrap without shared memory, ICU
time zones on Haiku (no zoneinfo files; the conditions now name Haiku
rather than changing them for every platform), and the shared memory
retry without O_CLOEXEC, which 6.12 dropped there. New for 6.12: the TCP
keepalive idle option only where TCP_KEEPALIVE or TCP_KEEPIDLE exists (Haiku
has neither).

Ported 2026, haiku-odroid-c2 port authors.

